<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=a1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles_2876/201901/2019012314101102.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles_2876/201901/2019012314101102.jpg" width=1200 height=910> </A></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=a1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">傅芳芳，学科教学英语专业研究生，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US>1990</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">年</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US>12</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">月出生，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US>2012</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">年加入中国共产党，现任浙江省绍兴市第一中学英语教师，现担任文科一（语英）支部支部委员，积极协助支部书记完成各项工作任务，辛勤工作，求真务实，努力做好本职工作；认真听取各位老师的建议，不断完善工作，时刻谨记为人民服务的使命。自任职以来，其默默工作，静静绽放，一路芬芳。其本人曾荣获校级先进工作者，所带班级曾荣获市直先进班集体。另外，其担任学校英语沙龙社指导老师期间，社团所进行的活动在学生和老师中反响极好，效果极佳，为学生生活增添了色彩，提高了学生的责任意识和奉献精神。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=a0><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi" lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: 1pt; FONT-FAMILY: 方正小标宋简体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=Calibri>人</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: 1pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 方正小标宋简体" lang=EN-US>|</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: 1pt; FONT-FAMILY: 方正小标宋简体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=Calibri>物</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: 1pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 方正小标宋简体" lang=EN-US>|</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: 1pt; FONT-FAMILY: 方正小标宋简体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=Calibri>感</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: 1pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 方正小标宋简体" lang=EN-US>|</SPAN><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: 1pt; FONT-FAMILY: 方正小标宋简体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">言</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: 1pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 方正小标宋简体" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 20.95pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 1.31" class=a1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">坚守初心，静心学习，用心教书。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=a0><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi" lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=a0><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">绍兴市第一中学傅芳芳老师忠于职守，爱岗敬业，为人师表，实事求是，遵纪守法，始终以优良的思想道德品质和踏实的工作作风、精湛的教学水平和良好的言行举止努力为学校教育教学的改革和发展作出自己的贡献。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=a0><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi" lang=EN-US><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=a><FONT size=5><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: windowtext; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">更新理念，与时俱进</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: windowtext; mso-fareast-font-family: 黑体" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=a0><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">傅芳芳坚决拥护中国共产党的领导，坚持以马克思列宁主义、毛泽东思想、邓小平理论、“三个代表”重要思想、科学发展观、习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想为指导，以科学的理论知识武装头脑，为学校的教育工作和党支部的委员工作奠定了理论基础；坚持把党的政治建设摆在首位，坚决维护习近平总书记全党核心、军队统帅、人民领袖的崇高地位，坚决维护以习近平同志为核心的党中央权威和集中统一领导，认真贯彻党的群众路线，锲而不舍加强作风建设。全面贯彻党和国家的教育方针，积极领会十九大会议精神，切实转变教育思想观念，树立新的教育观、学生观、教学质量观，把实现现代化和中华民族伟大复兴作为自己的历史使命和奋斗目标，从而进一步增强做好教育工作和党务工作的使命感和责任感，以坚定的理想信念和较高的政治素养全身心地投入到教育工作和党务工作中去。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=a0><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi" lang=EN-US><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=a><FONT size=5><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: windowtext; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">积极工作，求真务实</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: windowtext; mso-fareast-font-family: 黑体" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=a0><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">自工作以来，傅芳芳一直贯彻党的方针政策，严以律己，积极地参与学校的党组织活动，认真履行岗位职责，密切地联系群众，在师生中树立了良好的形象。作为支部的宣传委员，主要负责支部的宣传工作，协助支部书记组织党员学习党的基本理论、基本知识和时事政策，组织党课学习，做好思想政治工作；利用支部活动室宣传党的路线方针政策、党的工作重心、任务和学习材料；同时做好党费收缴工作，按时上交文科一支部的党费。认真地做好每次党支部活动的记录，认真观看和学习党的方针政策，从而进行更好地宣传和自我的提升。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=a0><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi" lang=EN-US><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=a><FONT size=5><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: windowtext; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">热爱事业，认真踏实</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: windowtext; mso-fareast-font-family: 黑体" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=a0><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">作为青年教师，她能立足岗位、不断学习、学以致用，做好本职工作，心无旁骛地提升其教学素养，甘守三尺讲台。同时，她不断地思考如何以学生为主体，促进学生发展，培养学生的学科核心素养，不断完善其课堂，让学生敢于用英语表达自己的想法，课堂效果极佳。同时，她还研讨教材，通读文章，分析文本，精心设计教学方案，认真批改学生作业、灵活运用课堂管理，尽其所能地教会学生，教好学生。同时，她求知若渴，一有时间和机会，便会向有经验的老师讨教经验和教学方法，探讨教学问题，并珍惜每一次听课的机会，做好听课笔记。另外，她态度认真负责，通过阅读大量相关书籍汲取正能量，把一些先进、科学、有效的教学方法和现代教学手段灵活运用于课堂教学中，努力培养学生的合作交流、自主探究和用于创新的能力，同时勇于剖析自我，不断地提高自身素质。她热爱着课堂，热爱着这个事业，也会一直坚守下去。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=a0><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi" lang=EN-US><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=a><FONT size=5><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: windowtext; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">关爱学生，真情奉献</SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 方正小标宋简体" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></FONT></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=a0><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">在傅芳芳的眼里，学生是那么可爱，那么鲜活，同时也是那么年轻，他们需要她去教育和关怀。她总是花时间和精力去关注学生们的兴趣和热门话题，通过了解这些方面，更容易走进他们的生活和学习，并时时给予关心，常常关注学生的状态，及时送上温暖和关怀。尤其是担任班主任期间，她更是日夜坚守在岗位中，守护着学生们。和班级里的学生们一起拔草，体会劳动的艰辛和快乐；一起为参加运动会的运动健将们加油鼓劲，体悟班级的团结和活力；一起在浙大校园远足，感受知识的厚度和深度远足；一起精心准备班级元旦汇演，享受艺术的熏陶。她尽她所能地陪伴在他们身边，和他们一起成长，她说：“只要看到他们快乐健康地成长就很开心。”学生和家长们对傅芳芳老师的评价也是极高，她就是这样一个全身心投入事业和工作的老师，在这个既平凡又崇高的岗位上默默地耕耘着，用心陪伴着学生成长，静静地等待着他们绽放。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=a0><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi" lang=EN-US><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
    
    </div><!--endprint-->
